<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BOARD XI V INDIA MATCH DRAWN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BOARD XI V INDIA MATCH DRAWN.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>India drew their three-day match</p>
<p>against the Sri Lanka Board President's XI on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 308 and 255-5, Board President's XI 291.</p>
</text>
